{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792813566, "title": "aws-market-pipeline on LocalStack"}
[0.0, "o", "aws-market-pipeline: the whole pipeline on LocalStack, $0\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\r\n==> 1. Check the tools\r\n"]
[0.875, "o", "    Python 3.12.5, Terraform v1.16.6, Docker running\r\n"]
[0.875, "o", "    (1 s)\r\n"]
[0.875, "o", "\r\n==> 2. Build the processor (DuckDB) and API (pydantic-core) packages\r\n"]
[0.875, "o", "    $ python.exe scripts/build_lambda.py processor --arch x86_64\r\n"]
[4.282, "o", "    built .build\\processor-x86_64 (61 MB)\r\n"]
[4.297, "o", "    $ python.exe scripts/build_lambda.py api --arch x86_64\r\n"]
[8.313, "o", "    built .build\\api-x86_64 (10 MB)\r\n"]
[8.313, "o", "    (7 s)\r\n"]
[8.313, "o", "\r\n==> 3. Start LocalStack 4.14 in Docker\r\n"]
[8.375, "o", "    $ docker compose up -d --wait\r\n"]
[20.657, "o", "     Container market-pipeline-localstack Healthy \r\n"]
[20.672, "o", "    (12 s)\r\n"]
[20.672, "o", "\r\n==> 4. Apply infra/envs/local: Kinesis, Firehose, Lambdas, DynamoDB, S3, API\r\n"]
[20.672, "o", "    $ terraform.exe init -input=false -no-color\r\n"]
[22.563, "o", "    Terraform has been successfully initialized!\r\n"]
[22.579, "o", "    $ terraform.exe apply -auto-approve -input=false -no-color -var=lambda_architecture=x86_64\r\n"]
[100.688, "o", "    Apply complete! Resources: 52 added, 0 changed, 0 destroyed.\r\n"]
[101.547, "o", "    (81 s)\r\n"]
[102.391, "o", "\r\n==> 5. One live tick: feed -> producer -> Kinesis -> processor -> DynamoDB -> API\r\n"]
[103.344, "o", "    invoked market-pipeline-local-producer: {\"ok\": true, \"sent\": 3, \"failed\": 0}\r\n"]
[105.141, "o", "    tick reached the API 2.8 s after the invoke\r\n"]
[105.172, "o", "    GET /health (no key)                       200  {\"status\": \"ok\", \"version\": \"0.1.0\"}\r\n"]
[105.204, "o", "    GET /prices/BTCUSDT                        200  {\"symbol\": \"BTCUSDT\", \"price\": 80953.39, \"ts\"...\r\n"]
[105.235, "o", "    GET /bars/BTCUSDT?limit=2&window=30        200  {\"symbol\": \"BTCUSDT\", \"start\": \"2026-10-24T02...\r\n"]
[105.25, "o", "    GET /prices/BTCUSDT (no key)               403  {\"message\": \"Forbidden\"}\r\n"]
[105.25, "o", "    (3 s)\r\n"]
[105.25, "o", "\r\n==> 6. Load test: 20 ticks/s for 20 s, every tick counted once\r\n"]
[106.329, "o", "    run C0EE6E: 20 ticks/s for 20 s over 5 symbols"]
[106.329, "o", "\r\n"]
[126.438, "o", "    sent 400 ticks; waiting for them to land"]
[126.438, "o", "\r\n"]
[128.891, "o", "\r\n"]
[128.891, "o", "    load test C0EE6E on infra/envs/local (LocalStack)\r\n    offered     20 ticks/s for 20 s: 400 ticks over 5 symbols, 19.9 ticks/s achieved\r\n    kinesis     0 records retried, 0 dropped\r\n    landed      400 of 400 ticks in DynamoDB bars, the last 2.4 s after the last send\r\n    throughput  17.8 ticks/s end to end\r\n    processed   400 records in 16 batches (mean 25.0, max 34)\r\n      pace      18.9 records/s from the first batch to the last (21.1 s)\r\n    errors      0 malformed records, 0 failed symbols\r\n    lag ms      p50 1,367  p95 1,742  max 1,742   (per batch: its oldest tick)\r\n      from arrival p50 1,353  p95 1,728  max 1,728   (minus 14 ms generator-to-Kinesis offset)\r\n    duration ms p50 350  p95 721  max 721   (processor invocations)"]
[128.891, "o", "\r\n"]
[128.891, "o", "\r\n    saved .build\\load\\C0EE6E.json"]
[128.891, "o", "\r\n"]
[129.204, "o", "    (24 s)\r\n"]
[129.204, "o", "\r\n==> 7. Chaos: poison records on the stream, then a bad API deploy\r\n"]
[129.204, "o", "    $ python.exe -m pytest -m chaos tests/integration -v -k poison or bad_deploy -p no:cacheprovider\r\n"]
[146.391, "o", "    ====================== 2 passed, 21 deselected in 16.09s ======================\r\n"]
[146.454, "o", "    (17 s)\r\n"]
